msgid "The training materials are specifically created to comply with national laws of Germany. This compliance is however restricted only to laws that are applicable throughout the entire country. The training materials may not comply with local German laws, regulations, or laws of other countries outside of Germany. It is the responsibility of the Buyer to verify whether this poses any risks to the users or others and take appropriate actions."
