msgid "The training materials are presented in a template format. It is the Buyer's responsibility to make any necessary adjustments to the content before use. This should be done based on a risk assessment conducted by a competent person. The designated person assume overall responsibility for the content of the training material, as well as responsibility for carrying out a risk assessment and adapting the training courses. If no person is designated, the person who made the purchase shall be responsible."
