#: Terms of use
msgid "The purpose of the training materials is to improve safety awareness of the users. This training is NOT a substitute for practical exercises and on-site safety training that must be in line with the Buyer's workplace's risk assessment. It is the responsibility of the Buyer to communicate this information to all users. To perform occupational safety trainings, it is recommended that the Buyer hire qualified professionals in their field."
